                     <title>A. Essebiensis, etc</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Article 6 in this manuscript is Henry of
                        Avranches's poem on St Oswald, addressed to the monks of Peterborough; the
                        Peterborough copy was recorded in their catalogue (the 'matricularium') as
                        R.iv.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
